# Editor directories and files
# Trellis uses .claude/ for project-scoped workflow hooks and skills. Keep
# machine-local Claude permissions out of the repository, but share the
# generated project integration with the other supported coding agents.
.claude/settings.local.json
.vscode/
.idea
.DS_Store
*.suo
*.ntvs*
*.njsproj
*.sln
*.sw?

# Trellis keeps its local-only identity and runtime files in .trellis/.gitignore.
# Specs, task artifacts, workflow files, and journals are project records and
# remain visible to Git so future coding sessions can recover the context.
